 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "curious",
   "cam": "CU",
   "text": "Grandpa, the goat took a bite out of the camp sign's QR code. It still works. How?",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 4.18,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 16
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "amused",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "Of course it does. It was built for goats.",
   "s": 4.9,
   "e": 7.52,
   "w0": 17,
   "w1": 25
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "surprised",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "Built for goats?",
   "s": 8.26,
   "e": 9.08,
   "w0": 26,
   "w1": 28
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "matter-of-fact",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "For car factories. Japan, 1994. Oily, scratched labels. Close enough.",
   "s": 9.56,
   "e": 16,
   "w0": 29,
   "w1": 38
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "curious",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "Okay, but what is it? It's just squares.",
   "s": 16.6,
   "e": 18.54,
   "w0": 39,
   "w1": 46
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "warm",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "Each tiny square is a yes or a no. Dark is one, light is zero. Eight make a letter.",
   "s": 19.1,
   "e": 25.58,
   "w0": 47,
   "w1": 65
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "thinking",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "So the map link is written in squares.",
   "s": 26.02,
   "e": 27.72,
   "w0": 66,
   "w1": 73
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "pleased",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "In a zigzag, starting from the bottom right corner.",
   "s": 27.72,
   "e": 31.14,
   "w0": 74,
   "w1": 82
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "curious",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "And the three big squares in the corners?",
   "s": 31.84,
   "e": 33.36,
   "w0": 83,
   "w1": 90
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "firm, light",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "Those say, \"here I am.\" Sideways or upside down, the phone still finds them.",
   "s": 33.9,
   "e": 39.06,
   "w0": 91,
   "w1": 104
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "confused",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "Why three? There are four corners.",
   "s": 39.7,
   "e": 41.66,
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 110
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "amused",
   "cam": "2S",
   "text": "The empty corner is how it knows which way is up.",
   "s": 42.16,
   "e": 44.94,
   "w0": 111,
   "w1": 121
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "shocked",
   "cam": "CU",
   "text": "But the goat ate squares. Those letters are gone!",
   "s": 45.28,
   "e": 48.04,
   "w0": 122,
   "w1": 130
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "matter-of-fact",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "So the code carries spare squares. Extra math, spread across the grid. Lose a bite, the math rebuilds it.",
   "s": 48.44,
   "e": 55.22,
   "w0": 131,
   "w1": 149
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "curious",
   "cam": "OTS",
   "text": "How big a bite?",
   "s": 55.64,
   "e": 56.44,
   "w0": 150,
   "w1": 153
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "firm, light",
   "cam": "MS",
   "text": "Up to thirty percent. That's why some codes have a logo in the middle.",
   "s": 56.44,
   "e": 60.3,
   "w0": 154,
   "w1": 167
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "sp": "B",
   "beat": "grinning",
   "cam": "CU",
   "text": "So the goat could have eaten more?",
   "s": 60.48,
   "e": 61.56,
   "w0": 168,
   "w1": 174
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "sp": "A",
   "beat": "dry, flat",
   "cam": "CU",
   "text": "Plenty. Please don't tell the goat.",
   "s": 61.86,
   "e": 63.92,
   "w0": 175,
   "w1": 180
  }
 ],
