 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, the goat took a",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 1.08,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "bite out of the camp",
   "s": 1.14,
   "e": 1.86,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "sign's QR code.",
   "s": 1.92,
   "e": 2.94,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It still works. How?",
   "s": 3,
   "e": 4.53,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Of course it does.",
   "s": 4.9,
   "e": 6.19,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was built for goats.",
   "s": 6.46,
   "e": 7.87,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Built for goats?",
   "s": 8.26,
   "e": 9.43,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "For car factories.",
   "s": 9.56,
   "e": 10.69,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Japan, 1994.",
   "s": 11.4,
   "e": 12.75,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Oily, scratched labels.",
   "s": 13.28,
   "e": 15.05,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Close enough.",
   "s": 15.46,
   "e": 16.35,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay, but what is it?",
   "s": 16.6,
   "e": 17.84,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's just squares.",
   "s": 17.9,
   "e": 18.89,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each tiny square is a",
   "s": 19.1,
   "e": 20.54,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "yes or a no.",
   "s": 20.6,
   "e": 21.93,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dark is one,",
   "s": 22.16,
   "e": 23.23,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "light is zero.",
   "s": 23.38,
   "e": 24.53,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight make a letter.",
   "s": 24.78,
   "e": 25.93,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the map link",
   "s": 26.02,
   "e": 26.78,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "is written in squares.",
   "s": 26.84,
   "e": 27.66,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "In a zigzag,",
   "s": 27.72,
   "e": 29.56,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "starting from the bottom right corner.",
   "s": 29.62,
   "e": 31.49,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the three big",
   "s": 31.84,
   "e": 32.48,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "squares in the corners?",
   "s": 32.54,
   "e": 33.71,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Those say,",
   "s": 33.9,
   "e": 34.74,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"here I am.\" Sideways",
   "s": 34.8,
   "e": 36.34,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "or upside down,",
   "s": 36.4,
   "e": 37.7,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the phone still finds them.",
   "s": 37.76,
   "e": 39.41,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Why three?",
   "s": 39.7,
   "e": 40.61,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "There are four corners.",
   "s": 40.7,
   "e": 42.01,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The empty corner is",
   "s": 42.16,
   "e": 43.26,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "how it knows which",
   "s": 43.32,
   "e": 44.16,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "way is up.",
   "s": 44.22,
   "e": 45.22,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the goat ate squares.",
   "s": 45.28,
   "e": 46.75,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Those letters are gone!",
   "s": 47,
   "e": 48.38,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the code carries spare squares.",
   "s": 48.44,
   "e": 50.45,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Extra math,",
   "s": 50.84,
   "e": 51.36,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "spread across the grid.",
   "s": 51.42,
   "e": 52.95,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Lose a bite,",
   "s": 53.26,
   "e": 54.15,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the math rebuilds it.",
   "s": 54.22,
   "e": 55.57,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "How big a bite?",
   "s": 55.64,
   "e": 56.38,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Up to thirty percent.",
   "s": 56.44,
   "e": 58.05,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why some codes have",
   "s": 58.22,
   "e": 59.38,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "a logo in the middle.",
   "s": 59.44,
   "e": 60.42,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the goat could",
   "s": 60.48,
   "e": 60.96,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "have eaten more?",
   "s": 61.02,
   "e": 61.8,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Plenty. Please don't tell the goat.",
   "s": 61.86,
   "e": 64.27,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
